    resembles one (consistent with the orchestrating session's finding of zero
    Altruist/KMS-shaped secrets in Doppler prd/dev). DECISION: implement application-layer
    Fernet symmetric encryption (services/altruist_oauth.py), keyed by a new env var
    ALTRUIST_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY (intended to be Doppler-sourced in real deployment;
    does not exist there yet — a real, separate blocker from the sandbox-creds one,
    noted below). KMS envelope encryption is the intended production path per the
    sprint's own instructions; this Fernet layer is the documented interim fallback.
    client_secret/access_token/refresh_token are stored ONLY as encrypted bytea plus
    a last-4 plaintext reference column for audit/display — never plaintext.

